+/* A fit picked here takes the framing over. The launcher's Zoom and Stretch
+ * dials decide the rect whenever they are set (letterbox_rect_aspect: zoom
+ * replaces the letterbox/fill choice, stretch 100 fills like STRETCH), so on
+ * a preset that sets them - Enhanced has zoom 0 and stretch 100 - LETTERBOX,
+ * STRETCH and FILL all drew the same picture and the row looked dead. Handing
+ * framing back to the fit makes every value look like its name; the launcher
+ * keeps the dials cleared too (menu_prefs_write). */
